  "prefLabel": "Nur 702.03 Scores",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 702.03 Scores. A candidate shall successfully complete the written part and the skills demonstration part of the competency evaluation, noted in Nur 702.01(a), as set forth in Nur 702.02(b) and Nur 702.02(c), to be eligible to apply for licensing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Nur 100) #5887, eff 8-26-94; ss by #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #7738, eff 8-6-02\n\nNew. #8873, eff 4-24-07 (formerly Nur 703.03); ss by #10302, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10570, eff 4-17-14",
